## Editing content

- **Pages** are built from blocks (hero, rich text, media, call to action). The page with the slug `home` is the home page.
- **Posts** have a cover image, an excerpt and a publication date, and are listed at `/posts`.
- **Site settings** hold the site name, the links of the header and the text of the footer.
- Pages and posts have drafts, versions and a preview of the draft on the real site, and live preview refreshes it as you type.
- A published, changed or deleted page or post reaches the site at once. A new one exists without a deploy.

