## Migrations

The schema only changes through committed migrations, never by pushing it:

1. Change a collection.
2. `{{runScript "migrate:create" "<name>"}}` writes the migration and its snapshot into `apps/web/src/migrations/`. Read it: it must be a delta. Commit both.
3. `{{runScript "migrate"}}` applies it to the local database.
4. `{{runScript "generate:types"}}` and `{{runScript "generate:importmap"}}` regenerate the Payload types and the admin import map. Commit them too.

## Media

Images go to R2 and are limited to 20 MB. `sharp` does not run on Workers, so nothing resizes, crops or converts an image: upload it at the size it is shown, and set where it is framed with the focal point fields of the media. Resizing at delivery uses Cloudflare Images transformations (`/cdn-cgi/image/`), which needs a zone: it answers 404 on a `workers.dev` address.{{#if (ne agentContext false)}} [`docs/agents/media.md`](docs/agents/media.md) has the details.{{/if}}

